    <edge source="proxy:PHL-H05" target="indicator:PHL">
      <data key="d23">proxy_for</data>
      <data key="d24">{}</data>
      <data key="d25">PHL-H05</data>
      <data key="d26">positive</data>
      <data key="d27">linear</data>
      <data key="d28">severe drop in BII where habitat transitions to agriculture</data>
      <data key="d29">BII is mathematically constructed using land-use change and human pressure data. As percentage of cropland/buildings increases, BII decreases proportionately due to habitat loss and fragmentation</data>
