      <data key="d39">-0.8140808039165188</data>
      <data key="d40">0.0</data>
      <data key="d41">-0.8827944576171503</data>
      <data key="d42">4196</data>
      <data key="d35" />
      <data key="d36">quadratic</data>
      <data key="d37" />
      <data key="d38">["Partial correlation failed to compute, preventing verification of relationship robustness after controlling for confounders (development level). The script acknowledges this but does not document whether the relationship holds independently of wealth.", "No explicit outlier detection or sensitivity analysis performed. With 4,196 observations and n_countries=194, individual countries or years with extreme values could disproportionately drive the very strong correlation (r=-0.814), especially given the panel structure.", "The hypothesis specifies log-linear functional form, but the script identified quadratic as best (marginally better AIC: 56854.6 vs 57057.6). The discrepancy is not discussed or reconciled.", "Hypothesis explicitly acknowledges non-independence ('partly constructed from same underlying assumptions') and collection-time bias, but the script does not flag this as a concern for the 'confirmed' verdict.", "Year alignment is correct (proxy and target merged on iso-year), but no check for whether the temporal range of available proxy data matches the hypothesis's claimed 1990\u20132021 period.", "World Bank proxy (SH.H2O.BASW.ZS) is authentic JMP data, but the script uses a fallback indicator (SH.H2O.SAFE.ZS) if the primary one fails. The result does not clearly indicate which was used."]</data>
    </edge>
