      <data key="d25">UWD-H07</data>
      <data key="d26">positive</data>
      <data key="d27">log-linear</data>
      <data key="d28">r ≈ 0.72</data>
      <data key="d29">Childhood diarrheal mortality directly reflects both water contamination and healthcare access; mortality is a component of UWD DALYs calculation</data>
      <data key="d30">confirmed</data>
      <data key="d39">0.9136089144853874</data>
      <data key="d40">1.17333855947201e-72</data>
