      <data key="d35" />
      <data key="d36">quadratic</data>
      <data key="d37" />
      <data key="d38">["Hypothesis specifies 'Infant/child diarrheal disease mortality rate' (age-specific, disease-specific, per 1,000 live births or per 100,000 children under 5); agent used SH.STA.WASH.P5 (all ages, all water/sanitation causes, per 100,000 general population). This is a material substitution.", "Data source mismatch: Hypothesis cites IHME Cause-Specific Child Mortality database; agent could not access it and substituted World Bank indicator SH.STA.WASH.P5. While documented in data_quality_notes, this is a different source with different methodology and population scope.", "Functional form discrepancy: Hypothesis claims log-linear relationship; result.json reports 'quadratic' as best fit (quadratic R\u00b2=0.839 vs log-linear R\u00b2=0.583, AIC 2206 vs 2378). The tested functional form contradicts the hypothesis's stated mechanism.", "n_observations=183 but n_countries=183 suggests each country has only 1 observation on average (likely single-year cross-sectional), not a proper panel. This misaligns with hypothesis's claim of 1990\u20132021 annual coverage.", "Mechanistic overlap caveat in hypothesis is not adequately addressed: the agent does not acknowledge that using a general WASH mortality proxy (SH.STA.WASH.P5) conflates multiple causal pathways beyond diarrheal disease."]</data>
    </edge>
